{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/tvm/issues/20329","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/tvm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/tvm/issues/20329/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/tvm/issues/20329/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/tvm/issues/20329/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/tvm/pull/20329","id":5436974349,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBDeBdM8AAAABDTAB8w","number":20329,"title":"[FIX][TIRx][CUDA] Support SM100 weight-stationary B collectors","user":{"login":"jinhongyii","id":44201588,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjAxNTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44201588?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinhongyii","html_url":"https://github.com/jinhongyii","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinhongyii/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinhongyii/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinhongyii/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinhongyii/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinhongyii/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinhongyii/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinhongyii/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinhongyii/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinhongyii/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-13T00:18:58Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T13:44:51Z","closed_at":"2026-09-13T13:44:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/tvm/pulls/20329","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/tvm/pull/20329","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/tvm/pull/20329.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/tvm/pull/20329.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-13T13:44:50Z"},"body":"The SM100 `tcgen05.mma.ws` SS/TS entries omit the collector-B modifier slot, preventing callers from expressing weight-stationary B reuse through the PTX namespace. Add the existing optional B0–B3 fill/use/lastuse/discard domain to both entries, preserving calls that omit the qualifier.\n\nAlso reject modifier-domain and operand-count mismatches during code generation, before stale table/codegen layouts can emit malformed CUDA helpers. Add dispatch and parser round-trip regressions, SM100 certification for all WS variants, and stale-layout diagnostics. Make the test source helper accept an explicit target so the existing SM107 collector test compiles at its required architecture.\n\nValidation with CUDA 13.4 NVCC/NVRTC and a matching worktree FFI:\n\n- PTX dialect, conversion, and address suites: 179 non-skipped cases passed across the full run and targeted reruns.\n- Full-table NVCC/ptxas certification: **32/32 shards passed**, including predicated helpers and address-offset samples at their declared architectures.\n- Regenerated IDE stubs: no diff needed; the tokens already exist in the ti16 families.\n- Changed-file pre-commit hooks and `git diff --check` passed.\n\nCloses #20328.\n","closed_by":{"login":"tqchen","id":2577440,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Nzc0NDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2577440?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tqchen","html_url":"https://github.com/tqchen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tqchen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tqchen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tqchen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tqchen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tqchen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tqchen/orgs"